  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening UNESCO&#x2019;s role in Sustainable Water Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve SDG 6 by 2030 it is necessary to accelerate the implementation of water-related SDGs, putting emphasis on partnerships between policymakers and science and technology communities. Within this framework, UNESCO&#x2019;s Intergovernmental Hydrological Programme (IHP) will support Member States towards sustainable water management and science-based water governance. The activity aims to support evidence-based policy for sustainable, inclusive water management and governance based on state-of-the-art science, research, engineering, technology, and innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
